  "summaries": {
    "A": {"adequacy": 2, "critical_unsupported": 0, "critical_omission": 1, "wrong_unit_qualifier": 0, "entity_relation": 0, "fluency": 2, "utility": 2, "evidence": ["양승조 충남지사가 도청으로 복귀한다", "주민들이 강하게 반발하자 “주민들이 불안해하지 않도록 교민들이 모두 퇴소할 때까지 이곳을 지키겠다”며 약속했다"], "reason": "The summary says he made a promise but never says what it was. It also leaves out his return to the provincial office, which is the main news. The last sentence is awkward and reads as if a 19-day stay began on the 31st."},
    "B": {"adequacy": 3, "critical_unsupported": 0, "critical_omission": 0, "wrong_unit_qualifier": 0, "entity_relation": 0, "fluency": 3, "utility": 3, "evidence": ["지난달 31일 충남 아산시 초사2통에 현장 집무실을 차린 지 19일 만이다", "교민들이 모두 퇴소할 때까지 이곳을 지키겠다"], "reason": "It accurately gives the 19 days, the press conference, the thanks and the promise to stay until all evacuees leave. It leaves out the return to the provincial office. The opening sentence is a fragment, so the wording is slightly awkward."},
    "C": {"adequacy": 2, "critical_unsupported": 1, "critical_omission": 0, "wrong_unit_qualifier": 1, "entity_relation": 0, "fluency": 3, "utility": 2, "evidence": ["양승조 충남지사는 18일 오전 11시 아산시 초사2통 현장대책본부에서 기자회견", "31일 충남 아산시 초사2통에 현장 집무실을 차린"], "reason": "It correctly includes the return to the provincial office and the promise. But it dates the press conference to the 31st, when the source says the 18th. That date error is a factual mistake, and it makes the 31st both the day the office opened and the day of the conference."},
    "D": {"adequacy": 3, "critical_unsupported": 0, "critical_omission": 1, "wrong_unit_qualifier": 0, "entity_relation": 0, "fluency": 3, "utility": 3, "evidence": ["주민들이 불안해하지 않도록 교민들이 모두 퇴소할 때까지 이곳을 지키겠다", "충남도는 초사2통 마을회관을 도지사 현장 집무실"], "reason": "It covers the return to the provincial office, the press conference, the thanks and the conversion of the village hall into the field office. But the promise is left vague, with the commitment to stay until all evacuees leave dropped. The villagers' acceptance is given only as a vague line about the village head."}
